WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.215
The Milky Way.

00:01.915 --> 00:09.806
Between one and four hundred billion stars, and the Sun is one of them, about 27 000 light-years from the centre.

00:10.256 --> 00:13.106
The shape is a model built from measurements.

00:13.556 --> 00:16.490
Nobody has seen our galaxy from outside.
